B.XR=new A.cr("ex","\u20b9500/month at 12% for 20 years \u2248 \u20b94.9 lakh. You put in only \u20b91.2 lakh \u2014 the remaining \u20b93.7 lakh is pure growth. That is less than \u20b917 a day!","\u20b9500/\u092e\u093e\u0939, 12% \u092a\u0930 20 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u2248 \u20b94.9 \u0932\u093e\u0916\u0964 Aapne lagaye sirf \u20b91.2 \u0932\u093e\u0916 \u2014 baaki \u20b93.7 \u0932\u093e\u0916 poori growth hai\u0964 Matlab din ke sirf \u20b917 se kam!")
B.Xy=new A.cr("p",'Markets go up and down, but SIP buys more units when prices fall and fewer when they rise \u2014 this is rupee-cost averaging. You never have to guess the "right time".','Bazaar upar-neeche hota rehta hai, par SIP sasta hone par zyada units kharidta hai aur mehnga hone par kam \u2014 isko rupee-cost averaging kehte hain\u0964 Aapko kabhi "sahi time" ka guess nahi karna padta\u0964')
B.XS=new A.cr("tip","Start with an amount you will never miss \u2014 even \u20b9100\u2013500. Increase it every year by 10% (step-up). Open the SIP Calculator in the app and see your own numbers.","Utni rakam se shuru kijiye jiski aapko kami kabhi na lage \u2014 chahe \u20b9100\u2013500 hi kyun na ho\u0964 Har saal ise 10% badhaiye (step-up)\u0964 App ke SIP Calculator me apne numbers khud dekhiye\u0964")
B.XW=new A.cr("key","Time in the market beats timing the market. Start small, start today.","Market me kitna TIME rahe \u2014 ye TIMEING se zyada mayne rakhta hai\u0964 Chhota shuru kijiye, aaj hi shuru kijiye\u0964")
